  "summary_en": "Mandatory operational policy for NSW Government agencies on AI use. It adopts Australia's AI Ethics Principles, sets accountability standards (Agency Head, Accountable Official, governance board, assurance), acceptable-use rules, AI use case registration, risk assessment via the AIAF, annual attestation and incident reporting. No robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Agencies must adhere to Australia's AI Ethics Principles and designate an Accountable Official.",
   "All AI use cases must be registered in the AIAF Platform; the AIAF risk assessment applies where required.",
   "Critical- and high-risk use cases must be referred to the AI Review Committee.",
   "Standard B requires meaningful human oversight, disclosure of AI content and safeguarding of government information.",
   "Annual attestation by 31 October from 2027 and mandatory AI incident reporting."
  ],
